        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="532.284094488189" YPOS="27.087874015748" OwnPage="0" ItemID="202871328" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="134.645669291339" HEIGHT="609.448818897638" FRTYPE="0" CLIPEDIT="0" PWIDTH="1" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="0" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="0" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 0 L134.646 0 L134.646 609.449 L0 609.449 L0 0 Z" copath="M0 0 L134.646 0 L134.646 609.449 L0 609.449 L0 0 Z" gXpos="532.284094488189" gYpos="27.087874015748" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle LINESPMode="0" LINESP="11" FONT="Roboto Light" FONTSIZE="10"/>
                <ITEXT FONT="Roboto Light" FONTSIZE="10" CH="01: "/>
                <ITEXT CH="Individual 20-million streamline whole brain tractograms are generated using tckgen and normalised white-matter FODs"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="02: Warp matrices created in Chapter 5 are used to transform T1-space Destrieux parcellations into DWI space, which are then converted into monotonically-increasing label files using labelconvert "/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="03: 30-million streamline tractograms are SIFTed down to 1-million tracts using tcksift"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="04: The SIFTed tractogram and normalised white matter FOD are used to compute tract weights, which are representative of per-streamline fibre-bundle capacities"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="05: Individual DWI connectomes are computed using the SIFTed tractograms, track weights, and DWI-space Destrieux label files"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="06: Destrieux-based ROI-to-ROI connectomes computed in Chapter 6 are transformed from Fisher scores to correlation coefficients, and then evaluated for graph properties and network-based statistics in R, using a combination of the NBR package and the iGraph package"/>
                <para/>
                <para/>
                <ITEXT CH="07: DWI-based connectomes are similarly processed, providing complementary graph and network measurements"/>
                <trail/>
            </StoryText>
        </PAGEOBJECT>
        <PAGEOBJECT XPOS="390.551811023622" YPOS="452.284724409448" OwnPage="0" ItemID="202940064" PTYPE="4" WIDTH="127.559" HEIGHT="42.5197" RADRECT="2.83464566929134" FRTYPE="3" CLIPEDIT="1" PWIDTH="0.708661596860741" SHADE="10" PCOLOR2="Registration" PLINEART="1" LOCALSCX="1" LOCALSCY="1" LOCALX="0" LOCALY="0" LOCALROT="0" PICART="1" SCALETYPE="1" RATIO="1" COLUMNS="1" COLGAP="0" AUTOTEXT="0" EXTRA="0" TEXTRA="0" BEXTRA="0" REXTRA="0" VAlign="1" FLOP="1" PLTSHOW="0" BASEOF="0" textPathType="0" textPathFlipped="0" path="M0 2.83465 C0 1.26911 1.26911 0 2.83465 0 L124.724 0 C126.142 0 127.559 1.41732 127.559 2.83465 L127.559 39.685 C127.559 41.2506 126.29 42.5197 124.724 42.5197 L2.83465 42.5197 C1.26911 42.5197 0 41.2506 0 39.685 L0 2.83465 Z" copath="M0 2.83465 C0 1.26911 1.26911 0 2.83465 0 L124.724 0 C126.29 0 127.559 1.26911 127.559 2.83465 L127.559 39.685 C127.559 41.2506 126.29 42.5197 124.724 42.5197 L2.83465 42.5197 C1.26911 42.5197 0 41.2506 0 39.685 L0 2.83465 Z" gXpos="283.818897548027" gYpos="425.551180757085" gWidth="652.676834645672" gHeight="397.559054330709" ALIGN="1" LAYER="0" NEXTITEM="-1" BACKITEM="-1">
